      "description": {
        "es": "Sin descripción disponible.",
        "en": "Moves used by or against this Pokémon never miss.\n\nOne-hit KO moves are unaffected.  Moves affected by this ability can hit Pokémon during the preparation turn of moves like Dig or Fly.\n\nOverworld: If the lead Pokémon has this ability, the wild encounter rate is doubled."
      }
